  "tc_last_updated": "Last Updated: June 2026",
  "tc_section1_title": "1. Introduction",
  "tc_section1_content": "Welcome to PayOn. These Terms and Conditions govern your use of our mobile application and services. By accessing or using PayOn, you agree to be bound by these terms.",
  "tc_section2_title": "2. Acceptance of Terms",
  "tc_section2_content": "By creating an account or using the App, you agree to these Terms and our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, you must not use our services.",
  "tc_section3_title": "3. User Eligibility",
  "tc_section3_content": "You must be at least 18 years old to use PayOn. By using the App, you represent that you have the legal capacity to enter into a binding agreement.",
  "tc_section4_title": "4. Account Registration",
  "tc_section4_content": "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities that occur under your account. You must provide accurate and complete information.",
  "tc_section5_title": "5. Transaction Rules",
  "tc_section5_content": "All transactions are final once processed. Users are responsible for verifying recipient details before confirming any payment or transfer.",
  "tc_section6_title": "6. Fees and Payments",
  "tc_section6_content": "We may charge fees for certain services. All applicable fees will be disclosed to you before you complete a transaction.",
  "tc_section7_title": "7. Prohibited Activities",
  "tc_section7_content": "You may not use PayOn for any illegal purposes, including money laundering, fraud, or the purchase of prohibited goods and services.",
  "tc_section8_title": "8. Intellectual Property",
  "tc_section8_content": "All content, features, and functionality on the App are the exclusive property of PayOn Inc. and are protected by international copyright and trademark laws.",
  "tc_section9_title": "9. User Content",
  "tc_section9_content": "You retain ownership of any data you upload, but you grant PayOn a license to use, store, and process such data to provide the services.",
  "tc_section10_title": "10. Third-Party Services",
  "tc_section10_content": "The App may integrate with third-party services. We are not responsible for the content or practices of these third parties.",
  "tc_section11_title": "11. Termination",
  "tc_section11_content": "We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time for violations of these Terms or suspicious activity.",
  "tc_section12_title": "12. Limitation of Liability",
  "tc_section12_content": "PayOn shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising out of your use of the services.",
  "tc_section13_title": "13. Disclaimer of Warranties",
  "tc_section13_content": "The services are provided 'as is' without any warranties of any kind, either express or implied.",
  "tc_section14_title": "14. Governing Law",
  "tc_section14_content": "These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction in which PayOn Inc. is registered.",
  "tc_section15_title": "15. Changes to Terms",
  "tc_section15_content": "We may update these Terms from time to time. Your continued use of the App after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the new Terms.",
